{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》昨晚假將軍澳電視城舉行，旗下逾200藝人傾巢而出，3屆視帝羅嘉良領軍登場大唱經典歌；</p><p>而馬國明與壓軸表演嘉賓許志安雖「世紀同場」，但最終巧妙安排下未有同框！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;藝人馬國明與</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:28.909998+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.254673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.254673+00:00","content_hash":"403073772d9d1dd648f8eab9eaa629e3ded9a5caa2c08afbc0b2a28cf34848ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}